  "changelog": "catalyst-method-auditor 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release focused on pre-auditing catalyst preparation and evaluation procedures in energy and chemical materials.\n- Designed to check the executability, reproducibility, attribution logic, comparability, and validation of performance claims.\n- Supports various input formats including screenshots, research papers, patents, proposals, and preliminary drafts without requiring standardization by the user.\n- Enforces a structured audit process and fixed reporting with clear requirements on terminology, workflow, and outputs.\n- Provides findings only in standardized HTML and Word reports, ensuring consistency and reliability of core conclusions.\n- Requires MCP service configuration for full functionality; otherwise, only provides an analytical framework.",
